\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 1. Trong ph\'e1t bi\uc0\u7875 u b\'e0i to\'e1n, c\u7847 n x\'e1c \u273 \u7883 nh framework chung cho h\u7879  th\u7889 ng, g\u7891 m c\'e1c c\'f4ng \u273 o\u7841 n ch\'ednh n\'e0o (ch\u432 a \u273 i v\'e0o ph\u432 \u417 ng ph\'e1p c\u7909  th\u7875 ).
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 L\uc0\u7895 i th\u432 \u7901 ng g\u7863 p:
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 X\'e1c \uc0\u273 \u7883 nh lu\'f4n ph\u432 \u417 ng ph\'e1p c\u7909  th\u7875  trong framework. L\'e0m nh\u432  v\u7853 y s\u7869  kh\'f4ng th\u7845 y \u273 \u432 \u7907 c nhi\u7873 u gi\u7843 i ph\'e1p c\'f3 th\u7875  c\'f3 trong c\'e1c c\'f4ng \u273 o\u7841 n, h\u7841 n ch\u7871  s\u7921  s\'e1ng t\u7841 o.
\fs35 \strokec2 \
\

\fs21 \strokec2 2. Trong ph\'e1t bi\uc0\u7875 u b\'e0i to\'e1n, c\u7847 n x\'e1c \u273 \u7883 nh \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\'e1c \u7849 n s\u7889  ph\u7843 i t\'ecm trong c\'e1c c\'f4ng \u273 o\u7841 n
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 L\uc0\u7895 i th\u432 \u7901 ng g\u7863 p:
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 Kh\'f4ng x\'e1c \uc0\u273 \u7883 nh \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\'e1c \u7849 n s\u7889  ph\u7843 i t\'ecm trong c\'e1c c\'f4ng \u273 o\u7841 n. L\'e0m nh\u432  v\u7853 y s\u7869  kh\'f4ng hi\u7875 u \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\'e1c gi\u7843 i ph\'e1p \u273 \'e3 \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\'f4ng b\u7889 .
\fs35 \strokec2 \
\

\fs21 \strokec2 3. Trong related works, c\uc0\u7847 n n\'eau \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\'e1c gi\u7843 i ph\'e1p SOTA v\'e0 so s\'e1nh ch\'fang v\u7899 i c\'f9ng c\'e1c c\u7897 t ti\'eau ch\'ed theo c\'e1c c\'f4ng \u273 o\u7841 n \u273 \'e3 n\'eau trong ph\'e1t bi\u7875 u b\'e0i to\'e1n.
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 L\uc0\u7895 i th\u432 \u7901 ng g\u7863 p:
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 M\uc0\u7895 i gi\u7843 i ph\'e1p \u273 \u432 \u7907 c tr\'ecnh b\'e0y v\u7899 i d\'e0n b\'e0i kh\'e1c nhau. L\'e0m nh\u432  v\u7853 y s\u7869  r\u7845 t kh\'f3 so s\'e1nh gi\u7843 i ph\'e1p n\'e0y v\u7899 i gi\u7843 i ph\'e1p kh\'e1c.
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 Kh\'f4ng tr\'ecnh b\'e0y c\'e1c gi\uc0\u7843 i ph\'e1p \u7913 ng v\u7899 i c\'e1c c\'f4ng \u273 o\u7841 n \u7903  m\u7909 c ph\'e1t bi\u7875 u b\'e0i to\'e1n. L\'e0m nh\u432  v\u7853 y s\u7869  kh\'f3 nh\u7853 n bi\u7871 t c\'e1c gi\u7843 i ph\'e1p \u273 \'e3 \u273 \'f3ng g\'f3p th\u7871  n\'e0o trong c\'e1c c\'f4ng \u273 o\u7841 n.
\fs35 \strokec2 \
\

\fs21 \strokec2 4. Trong giai \uc0\u273 o\u7841 n h\u7885 c, c\u7847 n n\'eau r\'f5 input, output x\'e1c th\u7921 c (groundtruth) l\'e0 g\'ec, \u273 \u432 \u7907 c \u273 \'e1nh nh\'e3n nh\u432  th\u7871  n\'e0o v\'e0 loss function l\'e0 g\'ec nh\u7857 m t\u7889 i \u432 u c\'e1c th\'f4ng s\u7889  c\u7911 a m\u7841 ng.
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 L\uc0\u7895 i th\u432 \u7901 ng g\u7863 p:
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 Kh\'f4ng \uc0\u273 \'e1 \u273 \u7897 ng g\'ec \u273 \u7871 n output x\'e1c th\u7921 c, v\'e0 \u273 \u432 \u7907 c d\'f9ng nh\u432  th\u7871  n\'e0o trong giai \u273 o\u7841 n h\u7885 c.
\fs35 \strokec2 \
\

\fs21 \strokec2 5. Trong giai \uc0\u273 o\u7841 n h\u7885 c v\'e0 giai \u273 o\u7841 n ki\u7875 m th\u7917 , c\u7847 n tr\'ecnh b\'e0y r\'f5 ti\u7871 n tr\'ecnh ho\u7841 t \u273 \u7897 ng c\u7911 a h\u7879  th\u7889 ng \u273 \u7875  ra \u273 \u432 \u7907 c k\u7871 t qu\u7843  mong mu\u7889 n.
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 L\uc0\u7895 i th\u432 \u7901 ng g\u7863 p:
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 Kh\'f4ng cho th\uc0\u7845 y \u273 \u432 \u7907 c h\u7879  th\u7889 ng ho\u7841 t \u273 \u7897 ng nh\u432  th\u7871  n\'e0o \u273 \u7875  ra \u273 \u432 \u7907 c k\u7871 t qu\u7843 .
\fs35 \strokec2 \
\

\fs21 \strokec2 6. Trong giai \uc0\u273 o\u7841 n \u273 \'e1nh gi\'e1 hi\u7879 u su\u7845 t c\u7911 a h\u7879  th\u7889 ng (performance), c\u7847 n x\'e1c \u273 \u7883 nh \u273 \u7897  \u273 o \u273 \'e1nh gi\'e1 v\u7873  \u273 \u7897  ch\'ednh x\'e1c v\'e0 c\u7843  \u273 \u7897  ph\u7913 c t\u7841 p t\'ednh to\'e1n.
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 L\uc0\u7895 i th\u432 \u7901 ng g\u7863 p:
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 Kh\'f4ng hi\uc0\u7875 u v\u7873  \u273 \u7897  \u273 o \u273 \'e1nh gi\'e1, \u273 \u7897  ph\u7913 c t\u7841 p t\'ednh to\'e1n.
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 Kh\'f4ng hi\uc0\u7875 u loss function c\'f3 li\'ean quan g\'ec \u273 \u7871 n \u273 \u7897  \u273 o \u273 \'e1nh gi\'e1. L\'e0m nh\u432  v\u7853 y c\'f3 th\u7875  d\u7851 n \u273 \u7871 n t\'ecnh tr\u7841 ng h\u7885 c m\u7897 t \u273 \u7857 ng, \u273 \'e1nh gi\'e1 m\u7897 t n\u7867 o.
\fs35 \strokec2 \
\

\fs21 \strokec2 7. C\uc0\u7847 n ch\'fa \'fd nhi\u7873 u h\u417 n trong m\'f4 t\u7843  t\u7853 p d\u7919  li\u7879 u h\u7885 c, t\u7853 p d\u7919  li\'eau ki\u7875 m th\u7917 . c\'f4ng t\'e1c \u273 \'e1nh nh\'e3n nh\u432  th\u7871  n\'e0o. S\u7889  l\u432 \u7907 ng m\u7851 u. T\'ednh \u273 a d\u7841 ng c\u7911 a m\u7851 u. Ti\'eau ch\'ed x\'e2y d\u7921 ng t\u7853 p m\u7851 u.
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 L\uc0\u7895 i th\u432 \u7901 ng g\u7863 p:
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 Kh\'f4ng cho th\uc0\u7845 y t\u7853 p d\u7919  li\u7879 u ch\u7913 a c\'e1c th\'e1ch th\u7913 c g\'ec. N\u7871 u t\u7853 p d\u7919  li\u7879 u kh\'f4ng ch\u7913 a c\'e1c th\'e1ch th\u7913 c c\u7911 a b\'e0i to\'e1n th\'ec d\'f9 h\u7879  th\u7889 ng c\'f3 \u273 \u7841 t performance r\u7845 t cao c\u361 ng kh\'f4ng th\u7875  kh\u7859 ng \u273 \u7883 nh \u273 \'e2y l\'e0 gi\u7843 i ph\'e1p t\u7889 t \u273 \u432 \u7907 c.
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 Kh\'f4ng hi\uc0\u7875 u \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\'e1ch \u273 \'e1nh nh\'e3n d\u7919  li\u7879 u nh\u432  th\u7871  n\'e0o.
\fs35 \strokec2 \
\

\fs21 \strokec2 8. Trong related works, c\uc0\u7847 n nh\'ecn ra c\'e1c khuy\u7871 t \u273 i\u7875 m c\'f2n t\u7891 n \u273 \u7885 ng c\u7847 n gi\u7843 i quy\u7871 t trong c\'e1c c\'f4ng \u273 o\u7841 n.
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 L\uc0\u7895 i th\u432 \u7901 ng g\u7863 p:
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 Ch\uc0\u432 a nh\'ecn ra \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\u7847 n c\u7843 i ti\u7871 n n\u7897 i dung g\'ec trong c\'e1c c\'f4ng \u273 o\u7841 n.
\fs35 \strokec2 \

\fs21 \strokec2 C\uc0\u7847 n c\u7843 i ti\u7871 n \u273 \u7897  ch\'ednh x\'e1c hay \u273 \u7897  ph\u7913 c t\u7841 p t\'ednh to\'e1n.
\fs35 \strokec2 \
}